  "initModel": {
    "defaults": null,
    "raw": "(model) => ({\n    ...model,\n    content: (!isNullOrWhiteSpace(model.content)\n      ? model.content\n      : `\n# Markdown Example\n\n## Basic Text\nThis is a paragraph with **bold text**, *italic text*, and ~~strikethrough text~~.\n\n## Lists\n- Bullet list item 1\n- Bullet list item 2\n\n1. Numbered list item 1\n2. Numbered list item 2\n\n## Links & Images\n[Shesha](https://www.shesha.io)  \n![Shesha Logo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/shesha-io/shesha-framework/main/shesha-reactjs/public/images/app-logo.png)\n\n## Code\nInline code: \\`print(\"Hello, world!\")\\`\n\nBlock code:\n\\`\\`\\`python\ndef greet(name):\n  return f\"Hello, {name}!\"\n\ngreet(\"world\")\n\\`\\`\\``).trim(),\n  })"
  },
